# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile bosonic circuits {#transpile-bosonic-circuits}"
msgstr "Pag-transpile ng mga bosonic circuit {#transpile-bosonic-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide explains how to transpile a [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") to a standard [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). A bosonic circuit carries no truncation, no encoding, and no qubit count (see [Work with bosonic circuits](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation)), so the transpiler is where those choices are made. The truncation and the encoding are described by a [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") (see [Describe the truncation with a LevelSpec](mappers#level-spec-explanation)), and the mapper that turns operators into qubit operators is described in [Map operator representations](mappers#mappers-explanation). The result is an ordinary [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), so any Qiskit-compatible simulator can run it.\n"
msgstr "Ipinaliliwanag ng gabay na ito kung paano i-transpile ang isang [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") sa isang karaniwang [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). Ang isang bosonic circuit ay walang truncation, walang encoding, at walang bilang ng qubit (tingnan ang [Work with bosonic circuits](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation)), kaya ang transpiler ang lugar kung saan ginagawa ang mga pagpiling iyon. Ang truncation at encoding ay inilalarawan ng isang [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") (tingnan ang [Describe the truncation with a LevelSpec](mappers#level-spec-explanation)), at ang mapper na nagpapalit ng mga operator sa qubit operator ay inilalarawan sa [Map operator representations](mappers#mappers-explanation). Ang resulta ay isang ordinaryong [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), kaya anumang simulator na compatible sa Qiskit ay kayang magpatakbo nito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The guide uses one small example throughout: two bosonic modes, a state with one boson in each, and a single time evolution under a Bose-Hubbard Hamiltonian whose bond and on-site terms are in separate groups (see [Group operator terms: use the operator structure](grouping#grouping-explanation)):\n"
msgstr "Gumagamit ang gabay ng isang maliit na halimbawa sa kabuuan: dalawang bosonic mode, isang state na may isang boson sa bawat isa, at iisang time evolution sa ilalim ng Bose-Hubbard Hamiltonian na ang bond at on-site na mga term ay nasa magkahiwalay na grupo (tingnan ang [Group operator terms: use the operator structure](grouping#grouping-explanation)):\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpilation stages {#transpilation-stages}"
msgstr "Mga stage ng transpilation {#transpilation-stages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As explained in [`qiskit_bosons.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler#module-qiskit_bosons.transpiler \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler\"), the preset pass managers in this package split the transpilation into the following stages:\n"
msgstr "Gaya ng ipinaliwanag sa [`qiskit_bosons.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler#module-qiskit_bosons.transpiler \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler\"), hinahati ng mga preset pass manager sa package na ito ang transpilation sa mga sumusunod na stage:\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Input** {#input}"
msgstr "**Pasok** {#input}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the circuit to a directed acyclic graph (DAG) data structure, the representation that every later pass works on.\n"
msgstr "Kino-convert ang circuit sa isang directed acyclic graph (DAG) na data structure, ang representasyong pinagtatrabahuhan ng bawat susunod na pass.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Optimization** {#optimization}"
msgstr "**Pag-optimize** {#optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keeps the circuit in bosonic space. These passes use the structure of the bosonic operators, in particular their groups, while no qubit information exists yet. [`B2BSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-b-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis\") is the pass that breaks gates down here, with a plugin for each type of gate: a product formula or qDRIFT for an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\"), and the Clements mesh for a [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") (see [Synthesize an Evolution gate in bosonic space](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation) for how a method is chosen). [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") reorders the modes. The preset decomposes mode rotations in this stage and leaves everything else as it is.\n"
msgstr "Pinananatili ang circuit sa bosonic space. Ginagamit ng mga pass na ito ang istruktura ng mga bosonic operator, partikular ang mga grupo nila, habang wala pang impormasyon tungkol sa qubit. Ang [`B2BSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-b-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis\") ang pass na naghahati-hati ng mga gate rito, na may plugin para sa bawat uri ng gate: product formula o qDRIFT para sa isang [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\"), at ang Clements mesh para sa isang [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") (tingnan ang [Synthesize an Evolution gate in bosonic space](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation) kung paano pinipili ang isang method). Ang [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") ay nagre-reorder ng mga mode. Dine-decompose ng preset ang mga mode rotation sa stage na ito at iniiwan ang lahat ng iba pa gaya ng dati.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Layout** {#layout}"
msgstr "**Pagkakaayos** {#layout}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maps each bosonic mode register to a quantum register. A bosonic mode generally occupies several qubits ($d$ of them under the unary encodings, $\\lceil \\log_2 d \\rceil$ under the compact ones), so the quantum register is wider than the mode register. [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") derives the register width from a [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\").\n"
msgstr "Nagma-map ng bawat bosonic mode register sa isang quantum register. Karaniwang gumagamit ang isang bosonic mode ng ilang qubit ($d$ sa ilalim ng unary encoding, $\\lceil \\log_2 d \\rceil$ sa ilalim ng compact), kaya mas malapad ang quantum register kaysa sa mode register. Hinuhugot ng [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") ang lapad ng register mula sa isang [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\").\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Synthesis** {#synthesis}"
msgstr "**Sintesis** {#synthesis}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts bosonic gates to qubit operations, one plugin per gate type. Encoding happens in this step: the plugin for an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate maps its operator to a qubit operator, and the plugin for an [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") gate sets the qubits that encode each occupation. A barrier is carried onto every qubit of each register it touched.\n"
msgstr "Kino-convert ang mga bosonic gate sa mga qubit operation, isang plugin bawat uri ng gate. Nangyayari ang encoding sa hakbang na ito: ang plugin para sa gate na [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") ay nagma-map ng operator nito sa isang qubit operator, at ang plugin para sa gate na [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") ay nagse-set ng mga qubit na nag-e-encode ng bawat occupation. Ang isang barrier ay dinadala sa bawat qubit ng bawat register na hinawakan nito.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qubit** {#qubit}"
msgstr "**Qubit** {#qubit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiles the resulting qubit circuit with Qiskit’s own methods, for example to a basis gate set or a device. The preset always includes it; by default it is Qiskit’s preset pass manager, which synthesizes every evolution into gates (see [Continue on the qubit level](#transpilation-qubit-stage)).\n"
msgstr "Tina-transpile ang nagresultang qubit circuit gamit ang sariling mga method ng Qiskit, halimbawa sa isang basis gate set o isang device. Palaging kasama ito sa preset; bilang default ito ang preset pass manager ng Qiskit, na nagsi-synthesize ng bawat evolution sa mga gate (tingnan ang [Continue on the qubit level](#transpilation-qubit-stage)).\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Output** {#output}"
msgstr "**Resulta** {#output}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the internal DAG data structure back to a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"
msgstr "Kino-convert pabalik ang internal na DAG data structure sa isang [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The truncation and the encoding are not stored in the circuit. They are given to the transpiler, and the layout, the state preparation, and the mapper must all agree on them. The preset ensures that by handing the same [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") to all three.\n"
msgstr "Hindi iniimbak sa circuit ang truncation at ang encoding. Ibinibigay ang mga ito sa transpiler, at dapat magkasundo ang layout, ang state preparation, at ang mapper tungkol sa mga ito. Tinitiyak ito ng preset sa pamamagitan ng pagbibigay ng parehong [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") sa lahat ng tatlo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "A practical example {#a-practical-example}"
msgstr "Isang praktikal na halimbawa {#a-practical-example}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") builds the pipeline from a spec. Lowering the example under two encodings only changes the spec. The preset ends in Qiskit’s own qubit-level transpilation, which would synthesize the evolution into gates. To see the circuit exactly as the bosonic stages emit it, empty that stage first:\n"
msgstr "Binubuo ng [`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") ang pipeline mula sa isang spec. Ang pagbaba ng halimbawa sa ilalim ng dalawang encoding ay spec lang ang binabago. Nagtatapos ang preset sa sariling qubit-level na transpilation ng Qiskit, na magsi-synthesize ng evolution sa mga gate. Para makita ang circuit nang eksakto kung paano ito inilalabas ng mga bosonic stage, alisan muna ng laman ang stage na iyon:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The two encodings use six and four qubits respectively (three levels per mode under the unary encoding, two qubits per mode under the Gray code), but the structure of the circuit is the same: two [`XGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate) operations prepare the occupations, and one [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) carries the evolution.\n"
msgstr "Ang dalawang encoding ay gumagamit ng anim at apat na qubit ayon sa pagkakasunod (tatlong level bawat mode sa ilalim ng unary encoding, dalawang qubit bawat mode sa ilalim ng Gray code), pero pareho ang istruktura ng circuit: dalawang operasyong [`XGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate) ang naghahanda ng mga occupation, at isang [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) ang may dala ng evolution.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare with the traditional workflow {#compare-with-the-traditional-workflow}"
msgstr "Ihambing sa tradisyonal na workflow {#compare-with-the-traditional-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [bosonic circuits](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation) guide describes the traditional workflow, which maps the Hamiltonian to a qubit operator *before* it builds the [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). The two routes produce equivalent circuits. They differ in what has to be redone when the truncation changes. The bosonic circuit is built once and lowered at every cutoff, whereas the map-first route needs the operator mapped again and the circuit rebuilt:\n"
msgstr "Inilalarawan ng gabay na [bosonic circuits](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation) ang tradisyonal na workflow, na nagma-map ng Hamiltonian sa isang qubit operator *bago* nito buuin ang [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). Gumagawa ang dalawang ruta ng magkaparehong circuit. Nagkakaiba sila sa kung ano ang kailangang ulitin kapag nagbago ang truncation. Ang bosonic circuit ay binubuo nang isang beses at ibinababa sa bawat cutoff, samantalang ang map-first na ruta ay nangangailangang mamapa muli ang operator at muling buuin ang circuit:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The entangling-gate count depends on how Qiskit synthesizes the evolution gate, which changes between releases, so plot it:\n"
msgstr "Nakadepende ang bilang ng entangling gate sa kung paano sini-synthesize ng Qiskit ang evolution gate, na nagbabago sa pagitan ng mga release, kaya i-plot ito:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![CX count of the lowered circuit against the number of levels d, growing quickly with d.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-bosons/transpilation-4.avif)\n"
msgstr "![CX count of the lowered circuit against the number of levels d, growing quickly with d.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-bosons/transpilation-4.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The count grows quickly with the cutoff, which is the reason to keep the cutoff a parameter of the transpilation and not of the circuit. The two routes are equivalent here, but only the bosonic one can also interleave the grouping of the operator with the product formula (see [Synthesize an Evolution gate in bosonic space](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation)) or hand the encoding to a different spec without changing a line of the circuit.\n"
msgstr "Mabilis na lumalaki ang bilang kasabay ng cutoff, kaya dapat panatilihing parameter ng transpilation ang cutoff at hindi ng circuit. Magkatumbas ang dalawang ruta rito, pero ang bosonic lang ang kayang magsingit ng grouping ng operator sa product formula (tingnan ang [Synthesize an Evolution gate in bosonic space](bosonic-synthesis#bosonic-synthesis-explanation)) o magpasa ng encoding sa ibang spec nang hindi binabago ang isang linya ng circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A spec with a single cutoff leaves the number of modes open, so one pass manager serves circuits of any width. A spec with one cutoff per mode fixes the width:\n"
msgstr "Ang isang spec na may iisang cutoff ay iniiwang bukas ang bilang ng mga mode, kaya isang pass manager ang nagsisilbi sa mga circuit na may anumang lapad. Ang isang spec na may isang cutoff bawat mode ay nagtatakda ng lapad:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the pipeline by hand {#build-the-pipeline-by-hand}"
msgstr "Buuin ang pipeline nang mano-mano {#build-the-pipeline-by-hand}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preset is a [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager) with one entry per stage. You can assemble the same pipeline from its parts, which is the starting point for every customization below:\n"
msgstr "Ang preset ay isang [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager) na may isang entry bawat stage. Maaari mong buuin ang parehong pipeline mula sa mga bahagi nito, na siyang panimulang punto ng bawat customization sa ibaba:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The mapper function receives an operator and the width of the register that the layout derived, and returns a [`SparseObservable`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparseObservable). Because it is given the width, passing `num_qubits` on to [`occupation_encoding()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-library-occupation-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding\") makes the mapper check that the spec fits the register, so a mismatch between the layout and the encoding fails with a clear message.\n"
msgstr "Ang mapper function ay tumatanggap ng isang operator at ang lapad ng register na nakuha ng layout, at nagbabalik ng isang [`SparseObservable`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparseObservable). Dahil ibinibigay sa kanya ang lapad, kapag ipinasa mo ang `num_qubits` sa [`occupation_encoding()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-library-occupation-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding\"), sinusuri ng mapper kung kasya ang spec sa register, kaya ang hindi pagtugma ng layout at ng encoding ay magpapakita ng malinaw na mensahe ng error.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced workflows {#advanced-workflows}"
msgstr "Mga advanced na workflow {#advanced-workflows}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Provide an explicit layout {#provide-an-explicit-layout}"
msgstr "Magbigay ng tahasang layout {#provide-an-explicit-layout}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`CustomB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-custom-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout\") replaces the layout stage with a mapping that you provide, from each bosonic register of the circuit to a quantum register. It is useful when the register must be wider than the spec needs, for example to leave idle qubits for other purposes:\n"
msgstr "Pinapalitan ng [`CustomB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-custom-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.CustomB2QLayout\") ang layout stage ng isang mapping na ikaw ang nagbibigay, mula sa bawat bosonic register ng circuit papunta sa isang quantum register. Kapaki-pakinabang ito kapag kailangang mas malapad ang register kaysa sa kailangan ng spec, halimbawa para mag-iwan ng mga idle na qubit para sa ibang gamit:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Warning\" type=\"caution\">\n"
"  A custom layout is your responsibility. The synthesis plugins still address qubits through the spec, so a register that does not match the spec’s widths gives a wrong circuit or an error deep inside a plugin. A custom layout also skips the check that [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") performs after [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") (see the next section).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Babala\" type=\"caution\">\n"
"  Ikaw ang may pananagutan sa custom na layout. Ina-address pa rin ng mga synthesis plugin ang mga qubit sa pamamagitan ng spec, kaya ang register na hindi tugma sa mga lapad ng spec ay magbibigay ng maling circuit o error sa kailaliman ng isang plugin. Nilalaktawan din ng custom na layout ang pagsusuring ginagawa ng [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") pagkatapos ng [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") (tingnan ang susunod na seksyon).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reorder the modes {#reorder-the-modes}"
msgstr "Ayusin muli ang mga mode {#reorder-the-modes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") is an optimization-stage pass that reorders the modes. The permutation is read as a mapping from original to new mode index, and it is recorded in the circuit metadata. The reordering changes which qubits each mode occupies, and so it can reduce the depth of the lowered circuit.\n"
msgstr "Ang [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") ay isang pass sa optimization stage na nag-aayos muli ng mga mode. Binabasa ang permutation bilang mapping mula sa orihinal patungo sa bagong mode index, at nire-record ito sa metadata ng circuit. Binabago ng pag-aayos muli kung aling mga qubit ang inookupahan ng bawat mode, kaya maaari nitong bawasan ang depth ng na-lower na circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because the result is expressed in the new mode order, measured bitstrings must be mapped back before they are interpreted. With several qubits per mode, the mapping acts on blocks of qubits and not on single bits. The following example relabels three modes, each occupying two qubits under the Gray code, and recovers the original occupation from the measured counts:\n"
msgstr "Dahil nakasulat ang resulta sa bagong ayos ng mga mode, kailangang i-map pabalik ang mga nasukat na bitstring bago bigyang-kahulugan. Kapag maraming qubit bawat mode, ang mapping ay umaaksyon sa mga block ng qubit at hindi sa mga indibidwal na bit. Nire-relabel ng sumusunod na halimbawa ang tatlong mode, na bawat isa ay may dalawang qubit sa ilalim ng Gray code, at binabawi ang orihinal na occupation mula sa mga nasukat na count:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The restored bitstring is what the circuit produces without the relabeling, read in Qiskit’s little-endian order: mode 0 holds the Gray code of level two (`11`), mode 1 holds level zero (`00`), and mode 2 holds level one (`01`).\n"
msgstr "Ang naibalik na bitstring ang ginagawa ng circuit nang walang relabeling, na binasa sa little-endian na ayos ng Qiskit: hawak ng mode 0 ang Gray code ng level dalawa (`11`), hawak ng mode 1 ang level zero (`00`), at hawak ng mode 2 ang level isa (`01`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Warning\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Babala\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  A spec that gives the modes **different** cutoffs cannot be combined with [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\"). The cutoffs are attached to the modes by their position, so reordering the modes would put a cutoff on the wrong mode. [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") refuses a relabeled circuit in that case:\n"
msgstr "  Ang spec na nagbibigay sa mga mode ng **magkakaibang** cutoff ay hindi maaaring pagsamahin sa [`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\"). Nakakabit ang mga cutoff sa mga mode ayon sa posisyon nila, kaya ang pag-aayos muli ng mga mode ay maglalagay ng cutoff sa maling mode. Tinatanggihan ng [`OccupationB2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-occupation-b-2-q-layout#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.OccupationB2QLayout\") ang na-relabel na circuit sa ganitong kaso:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the synthesis plugins {#choose-the-synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr "Piliin ang mga synthesis plugin {#choose-the-synthesis-plugins}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\") has no default plugins; the preset registers one per gate type. The available plugins are managed by [`B2QSynthesisPluginManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-synthesis-b-2-q-synthesis-plugin-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager\"), which lists them by the name of the gate they act on:\n"
msgstr "Walang default na plugin ang [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\"); nagrerehistro ang preset ng isa bawat uri ng gate. Ang mga available na plugin ay pinamamahalaan ng [`B2QSynthesisPluginManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-synthesis-b-2-q-synthesis-plugin-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.synthesis.B2QSynthesisPluginManager\"), na naglilista sa kanila ayon sa pangalan ng gate na kanilang inaaksyunan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The two builtin methods are `Evolution.MapperFn` and `InitializeModes.Occupation`. The first synthesizes an evolution from any mapper function, which is how a custom encoding is plugged in (see [Map operator representations](mappers#mappers-explanation)). The library ships no plugin for a [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") gate. The preset breaks it down in bosonic space into [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gates first, which the first method then handles, but a plugin registered for `ModeRotation` can lower the gate directly instead; see [Rotate bosonic modes](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-explanation) and [Lower a rotation without decomposing it](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-direct-explanation). You can register a method by name through the `config` argument of [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\"), or write a plugin object into [`B2QSynthesis.methods`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods\") directly, as the preceding examples do.\n"
msgstr "Ang dalawang builtin na method ay ang `Evolution.MapperFn` at `InitializeModes.Occupation`. Ang una ay nagsi-synthesize ng evolution mula sa kahit anong mapper function, na paraan kung paano isinasaksak ang custom na encoding (tingnan ang [Map operator representations](mappers#mappers-explanation)). Walang plugin na kasama ang library para sa isang [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") gate. Una itong hinahati ng preset sa bosonic space tungo sa mga [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate, na hinahawakan naman ng unang method, pero ang plugin na nakarehistro para sa `ModeRotation` ay maaaring direktang mag-lower ng gate; tingnan ang [Rotate bosonic modes](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-explanation) at [Lower a rotation without decomposing it](mode-rotation#mode-rotation-direct-explanation). Maaari kang magrehistro ng method ayon sa pangalan sa pamamagitan ng argumentong `config` ng [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\"), o magsulat ng plugin object direkta sa [`B2QSynthesis.methods`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis.methods\"), tulad ng ginagawa ng mga naunang halimbawa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"transpilation-qubit-stage\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Continue on the qubit level {#continue-on-the-qubit-level}"
msgstr "Magpatuloy sa antas ng qubit {#continue-on-the-qubit-level}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preset always ends in a `qubit` stage, which is Qiskit’s own preset pass manager. Keyword arguments of [`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") are handed to [`qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager), so you can translate to a basis gate set or target a device directly. Prefer `optimization_level=0` to keep the circuit close to what the bosonic stages produced:\n"
msgstr "Laging nagtatapos ang preset sa isang `qubit` stage, na siyang sariling preset pass manager ng Qiskit. Ang mga keyword argument ng [`generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-occupation-pass-manager#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_occupation_pass_manager\") ay ipinapasa sa [`qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager), kaya maaari kang mag-translate sa isang basis gate set o direktang mag-target ng device. Mas mainam ang `optimization_level=0` para manatiling malapit ang circuit sa nabuo ng mga bosonic stage:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two other choices are common. Assign an empty [`PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) to the `qubit` stage when you want to show the circuit exactly as the pipeline synthesized it, as the examples above do. Or assemble the pipeline yourself and add any Qiskit pass manager as the `qubit` stage of the [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager). Stages run in the order they are given, so the `qubit` stage must come before `output`, because Qiskit’s passes expect a DAG and not a finished circuit:\n"
msgstr "Dalawa pang pagpipilian ang karaniwan. Magtalaga ng walang laman na [`PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) sa `qubit` stage kapag gusto mong ipakita ang circuit nang eksakto kung paano ito na-synthesize ng pipeline, tulad ng ginagawa ng mga halimbawa sa itaas. O buuin mo mismo ang pipeline at magdagdag ng kahit anong Qiskit pass manager bilang `qubit` stage ng [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager). Tumatakbo ang mga stage ayon sa pagkakasunod na ibinigay, kaya ang `qubit` stage ay dapat mauna sa `output`, dahil inaasahan ng mga pass ng Qiskit ang isang DAG at hindi isang tapos na circuit:\n"

